won against easy: watch replay, note "You won · easy"; the first row outlined, the second lit
  a tap on it: a replay, at its end true, won by 0 (white 0)
  back: home
lost to easy: watch replay, note "You lost · easy"; the first row outlined, the second lit
  a tap on it: a replay, won by 1 (black 1)
  its back tile: home
a friend's game: watch replay, note "White wins"; the first row outlined, the second lit
lost on time: watch replay, note "You lost on time · easy"; the first row outlined, the second lit
a new game: continue, note ""; the first row lit, the second outlined
